### Test 5 — Límite diario de lecturas según plan (dolly=10, dolly_plus=20, dolly_pro=ilimitado)
### Nota: borrar lecturas con DELETE libera espacio de las 3 pendientes, pero NO devuelve el cupo diario usado.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:57011/api/v1
@email = qa-test5-{{$timestamp}}@example.com
@password = QaPassword123!

### 5.1 Registrar, seleccionar dolly (10/día), idioma es y categoría dinámica
# @name reg
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "fullName": "QA Daily Limits"
}

@token = {{reg.response.body.data.tokens.accessToken}}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/subscription
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tier": "dolly"
}

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/settings/languages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "languages": ["es"]
}

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/settings/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categories": ["historia del arte", "technology", "history"]
}

### 5.2 Consultar estado inicial (0 usadas / 10 disponibles hoy)
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/subscription
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5.3 Generar y evaluar/eliminar lecturas (repetir ciclo hasta llegar a 10 en dolly)
# @name rDay
POST {{baseUrl}}/readings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "historia del arte",
  "language": "es",
  "difficulty": "medium",
  "size": "short"
}

@readingId = {{rDay.response.body.data.id}}

### Evaluar para liberar cupo pendiente (o usar DELETE /readings/{{readingId}})
POST {{baseUrl}}/readings/{{readingId}}/evaluate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userResponse": "El texto explica la evolución histórica del movimiento artístico."
}

### Alternativa de prueba anti-trampa: eliminar lógicamente -> NO devuelve cupo diario
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/readings/{{readingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Al intentar la lectura #11 del día en dolly -> 429 READING_DAILY_LIMIT_REACHED
POST {{baseUrl}}/readings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "historia del arte",
  "language": "es"
}

### 5.4 Subir a dolly_plus (20/día): quedan 10 disponibles adicionales; al llegar a 20 la #21 falla con 429
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/subscription
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tier": "dolly_plus"
}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/user/subscription
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5.5 Subir a dolly_pro (sin límite diario): dailyReadingsLimit = null, sigue generando >20/día
POST {{baseUrl}}/user/subscription
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tier": "dolly_pro"
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/readings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "historia del arte",
  "language": "es"
}
